      "title": "Text Encode Qwen Image 2.1 - 姿态 / 脸部 / 服装三库分工",
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "ver": "0.43.0",
        "Node name for S&R": "TextEncodeQwenImage21",
        "ue_properties": {
          "widget_ue_connectable": {
            "prompt": true
          },
          "version": "8.0",
          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Create one coherent image from three references with separate roles. Image1 is the body-pose reference: follow its limb placement, body orientation, camera viewpoint and framing exactly. Image2 is the face and identity reference: it is a head-and-shoulders portrait, so keep this person's facial features, face shape, hairstyle, hair color, skin tone and overall look, and continue that same person downwards into a full body. Image3 is the outfit reference: dress the person in the garments and accessories shown there, preserving their colors, patterns, materials, layering and design details. Combine them into a single photo of one person: the body in the pose of Image1, the head of Image2, the clothes of Image3. Fit the clothes naturally to the posed body with coherent folds and occlusion, and keep the head, neck and shoulders anatomy consistent with the rest of the body. Do not copy the grey mannequin, line drawing, plain backdrop or annotations from the references, and do not produce a reference sheet or collage.",
        "",
        1024
      ]
    },
